<sect1 id="UdpDelaySimRunner_8h_1DESCRIPTION">
<title>DESCRIPTION</title>
<para>This <ref refid="classLtpFragmentSet" kindref="compound">LtpFragmentSet</ref> static class handles all functions required for creating or receiving/processing LTP report segments. It is a child class of util/FragmentSet. </para>
</sect1>
